 "brief": "The Izz ad-Din al-Qassam Brigades, the military wing of Hamas, released video footage documenting field commander Jihad Qazazer through its media platforms and the al-Tofan channel, according to Shehab Wire. The material chronicles Qazazer's background as a Qur'anic instructor before his involvement in armed operations against Israeli forces.\n\nThe video presents Qazazer as a commander who engaged in combat before his death. The brigades distributed the footage as a record of his life and activities during the conflict. Details of the circumstances surrounding his death and the timing of the release were not specified in the available reporting.",
